Testing that the wireless interfaces and wifi-vlans of the zone networks are
listed in the flowtable by the name netifd reports, whether the device exists
or not, so that the kernel binds the hook of a BSS that hostapd creates after
the ruleset was written. An interface of a network outside the zones, one
without a name yet, a name of IFNAMSIZ characters or more and status entries
that are not objects are skipped. An AP also gets its WDS port prefix.

